{"t":"Christmas Bakery","s":"christmas-bakery-08b67","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Christmas_Bakery_0230be.jpg","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 220px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\" The Christmas Bakery doesn't lack the season's spirit.\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"139\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Christmas_Bakery_0230be.jpg\" width=\"220\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\"> The <b>Christmas Bakery</b> doesn't lack the season's spirit.</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The Christmas Bakery is the only place where you can bake a <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbreadman\">Gingerbreadman</a> from a <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a>, if you've learnt the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Recipe\">Gingerbread Recipe</a> already. Use the lump on any oven, as if you were baking a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">Cake</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-How_to_get_there\">How to get there</span></h2>\n<p>Go past <a href=\"#/wiki/Ruprecht\">Ruprecht</a> at <a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a>, barely south from Santa's House. You will find a loose ice pile, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31944,31721,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (31944, 31721, 7)</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Vega loosepile\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vega_loosepile_b07da1.jpg\" width=\"210\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br/>\nUse a <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">shovel</a> to open the way down. Follow the short path to the bakery, there're no monsters. You will soon find yourself at the Christmas Bakery.\n</p></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest"]}